Quad4 smart fork of Forgejo
===========================

Remotes
  upstream  https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo.git  (fetch only, push disabled)
  origin    your own host (add with contrib/quad4/add-origin.sh)

Branches
  forgejo   tracks upstream/forgejo (clean Forgejo tip, do not commit here)
  quad4     your customizations live here (default working branch)

Sync upstream into your fork
  git checkout quad4
  contrib/quad4/sync-upstream.sh

Branding
  Default theme: quad4-dark
  Theme source: web_src/css/themes/theme-quad4-dark.css
  Logo master: contrib/quad4/brand/logo-transparent.png
  Raw AI export: contrib/quad4/brand/logo-1024.png / logo-raw.png
  SVG files are PNG embeds (do not hand-draw vectors)
  Rebuild: contrib/quad4/rebuild-brand.sh

GitHub
  origin  git@github.com:Quad4-Software/forge.git
  default branch: master
  GHCR    ghcr.io/quad4-software/forge:dev|latest
          ghcr.io/quad4-software/forge-rootless:dev|latest
  Actions .github/workflows/{ci,container,release}.yml

License
  Forgejo is GPLv3+. Distributed changes to this tree must stay GPLv3+ compatible.
